tionale":"Exact target-collocation fallback for this bounded A1 use."}],"noNewGrammarReason":"Lexical-focus integration: the provisional grammar reservation was no longer available in the live sequential curriculum spec, so this Lesson claims no new grammar."},"pedagogyVersion":2},"pilot":false,"audioRequired":true,"humanEnglishAuditRequired":true,"dialogueRuntime":"guided_exchange","qualityStage":"model_reviewed_for_testing","qualityV2Remediated":true,"qualityV2RemediationVersion":1}')
